{"seq":2,"slug":"safety-risk-hazard-assessment","title":"安全风险评估与危害分级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/safety-signal-incident-report/safety-risk-hazard-assessment","wordCount":1950,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"安全风险评估与危害分级\">安全风险评估与危害分级</h1><p>把一堆积压的伤害信号变成&quot;要不要上报、要不要召回&quot;的结论，中间隔着的就是风险评估。这一步的难点不在方法本身，而在两个工程约束：判定标准必须版本化可追溯，以及同类信号必须得到可比较的结论。前者决定监管问询时能不能解释清楚，后者决定运营能不能规模化处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个正交维度\">核心概念：三个正交维度</h2><p>产品安全的风险评估与信息安全的风险评估形似而神不同。信息安全关心&quot;可能性 × 影响&quot;，产品安全还必须多一个维度：<strong>暴露人群</strong>。一个只在成人手中会出现轻微划伤的缺陷，与同一个缺陷出现在婴儿用品上，结论可能相隔两个等级。因此产品安全的定级至少需要严重程度、发生可能性、暴露人群三个维度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[归一化后的信号] --&gt; B[确定危害类型]&#10;  B --&gt; C[评严重程度 S]&#10;  B --&gt; D[评发生可能性 P]&#10;  B --&gt; E[评暴露人群 V]&#10;  C --&gt; F[查风险矩阵]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{风险等级}&#10;  G --&gt;|严重| H[立即上报 + 停售评估]&#10;  G --&gt;|中等| I[补充证据 复评]&#10;  G --&gt;|轻微| J[记录监测]&#10;  I --&gt; H&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  H --&gt; K[进入召回决策]\">graph TD\n  A[归一化后的信号] --&gt; B[确定危害类型]\n  B --&gt; C[评严重程度 S]\n  B --&gt; D[评发生可能性 P]\n  B --&gt; E[评暴露人群 V]\n  C --&gt; F[查风险矩阵]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{风险等级}\n  G --&gt;|严重| H[立即上报 + 停售评估]\n  G --&gt;|中等| I[补充证据 复评]\n  G --&gt;|轻微| J[记录监测]\n  I --&gt; H\n  I --&gt; J\n  H --&gt; K[进入召回决策]</pre><p>三个维度的取值必须有明确锚点。共用一个模糊的 1-5 分制，会让不同评估人对同一信号打出不同的分，聚合后失去意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三维度的锚点定义\">三维度的锚点定义</h2><h3 id=\"严重程度-s\">严重程度 S</h3><p>严重程度描述的是<strong>伤害后果</strong>，不是可能性大小。锚点直接对齐 CPSC 对&quot;严重身体伤害&quot;的描述口径，可以让定级在跨市场时复用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>典型后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S1</td>\n<td>无伤害或仅财产损失</td>\n<td>表面划痕、功能失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S2</td>\n<td>轻微可逆伤害</td>\n<td>轻微烫伤、浅表割伤，居家处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>需医疗干预的伤害</td>\n<td>缝针、骨折、需就医的中毒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S4</td>\n<td>严重或不可逆伤害</td>\n<td>截肢、严重烧伤、重要功能丧失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S5</td>\n<td>致命或生命威胁</td>\n<td>死亡、窒息、电击致心脏骤停</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>S4 与 S5 的分界在实践中要格外小心：CPSC 对&quot;严重身体伤害（grievous bodily injury）&quot;的列举包含毁损、截肢、严重烧伤或电击、重要身体功能丧失、以及可能需要长期住院的伤害——这个口径比日常语感更宽，评估时宁高勿低。</p>\n<h3 id=\"发生可能性-p\">发生可能性 P</h3><p>可能性不能只看&quot;已发生几起&quot;，还要看&quot;暴露了多少件&quot;。100 万件里出 3 起与 100 件里出 3 起，性质完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>理论可能，无实例</td>\n<td>有失效机理但未观测到</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>罕见</td>\n<td>单起事件，且暴露量大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3</td>\n<td>偶发</td>\n<td>同型号多起，或同批集中出现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P4</td>\n<td>重复出现</td>\n<td>同一失效模式反复，且非个别批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P5</td>\n<td>可预期</td>\n<td>正常使用或可预见误用下即可触发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>P2 与 P3 之间用&quot;率&quot;而不是&quot;次数&quot;来判定，是这套锚点在工程上最实用的一点：把件数归一化后，跨品类才可比。</p>\n<h3 id=\"暴露人群-v\">暴露人群 V</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>人群</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>V1</td>\n<td>仅专业人士，有防护</td>\n<td>不加重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V2</td>\n<td>普通成人</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V3</td>\n<td>老年人、行动或认知受限者</td>\n<td>升一级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V4</td>\n<td>儿童（14 岁以下）</td>\n<td>升一级，强制快速通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V5</td>\n<td>婴幼儿（3 岁以下）</td>\n<td>升两级，强制快速通道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>V 的作用不是重算基分，而是对矩阵结果做<strong>等级上调</strong>。这种做法保留了基分的可解释性，同时让敏感人群的影响可审计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风险矩阵与定级\">风险矩阵与定级</h2><p>矩阵把 S 与 P 合成基础风险等级，再用 V 上调。这样设计的好处是：任何一个升级决定都能追溯到&quot;因为面向婴幼儿&quot;这一条明确理由。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>S \\ P</th>\n<th>P1</th>\n<th>P2</th>\n<th>P3</th>\n<th>P4</th>\n<th>P5</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S1</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S2</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S4</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>严重</td>\n<td>严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S5</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>严重</td>\n<td>严重</td>\n<td>严重</td>\n<td>严重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>矩阵的对角线不是均匀的：S5 在最低可能性下就已经是&quot;严重&quot;，因为致死类危害的容错空间为零；而 S1 即使高频也止步于&quot;中&quot;——这一类靠常规质量改进解决，不必动用召回。这种非对称是有意为之，它把稀缺的处置能力留给真正需要它的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;risk_matrix_version&quot;: &quot;2026.03&quot;,&#10;  &quot;severity&quot;: { &quot;S1&quot;: 1, &quot;S2&quot;: 2, &quot;S3&quot;: 3, &quot;S4&quot;: 4, &quot;S5&quot;: 5 },&#10;  &quot;probability&quot;: { &quot;P1&quot;: 1, &quot;P2&quot;: 2, &quot;P3&quot;: 3, &quot;P4&quot;: 4, &quot;P5&quot;: 5 },&#10;  &quot;base_level_rules&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;S&gt;=5&quot;, &quot;level&quot;: &quot;critical&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;S==4 and P&gt;=2&quot;, &quot;level&quot;: &quot;critical&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;S==4 and P==1&quot;, &quot;level&quot;: &quot;medium&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;S==3 and P&gt;=4&quot;, &quot;level&quot;: &quot;high&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;S&gt;=3 and P&gt;=2&quot;, &quot;level&quot;: &quot;medium&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;when&quot;: &quot;default&quot;, &quot;level&quot;: &quot;low&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;vulnerability_uplift&quot;: { &quot;V1&quot;: 0, &quot;V2&quot;: 0, &quot;V3&quot;: 1, &quot;V4&quot;: 1, &quot;V5&quot;: 2 },&#10;  &quot;uplift_order&quot;: [&quot;low&quot;, &quot;medium&quot;, &quot;high&quot;, &quot;critical&quot;],&#10;  &quot;regulatory_floor&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;any_V4_or_V5_with_S&gt;=3&quot;: &quot;high&quot;,&#10;    &quot;note&quot;: &quot;命中 regulatory_floor 时不得降级，只能升级&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"risk_matrix_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.03\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"S1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"S2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"S3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"S4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"S5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"probability\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"P1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"P2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"P3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"P4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"P5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"base_level_rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S>=5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"critical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S==4 and P>=2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"critical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S==4 and P==1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S==3 and P>=4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S>=3 and P>=2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"vulnerability_uplift\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"V1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"V2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"V3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"V4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"V5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"uplift_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"critical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"regulatory_floor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"any_V4_or_V5_with_S>=3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"命中 regulatory_floor 时不得降级，只能升级\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>regulatory_floor</code> 这段是把&quot;儿童相关不得降级&quot;从人的判断变成机器约束。它防止一个常见的失效模式：审核员基于&quot;只发生了一次&quot;把等级压到低，从而错过了本该上报的事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证据权重与不确定性\">证据权重与不确定性</h2><p>定级依赖的证据质量差异很大，需要显式区分，否则一条来自社交媒体的匿名描述会和一份实验室检测报告被同等对待。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据类型</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>可用于定级</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实验室检测报告</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>可复现，结论稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实物失效分析</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>能确认失效机理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管通报比对</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>用于校准，非个体归因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>具名客诉含就医记录</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>需交叉核实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品评价描述</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>参考</td>\n<td>用于模式识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匿名或社交媒体描述</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>仅作为升级触发器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>允许用低权重证据<strong>触发</strong>评估，但不允许用低权重证据<strong>支撑</strong>定级结论。这条分界让&quot;收到一条匿名爆料先查一查&quot;和&quot;据此认定存在严重风险&quot;变成两件事，既不错过信号，也不越权定论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"评估记录的可追溯结构\">评估记录的可追溯结构</h3><p>每次评估都要留下可复盘的记录，尤其是用了哪一版矩阵。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"create table risk_assessment (&#10;  id                bigserial primary key,&#10;  signal_id         bigint not null references safety_signal(id),&#10;  matrix_version    text   not null,&#10;  severity          text   not null,&#10;  probability       text   not null,&#10;  vulnerability     text   not null,&#10;  base_level        text   not null,&#10;  final_level       text   not null,&#10;  uplift_reason     text,&#10;  assessed_by       text   not null,&#10;  assessed_at       timestamptz not null default now(),&#10;  supersedes_id     bigint references risk_assessment(id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 复评时保留历史：只标记被取代，不删除&#10;select a.signal_id, a.matrix_version, a.final_level, a.assessed_at, a.uplift_reason&#10;from risk_assessment a&#10;where a.signal_id = $1&#10;order by a.assessed_at;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> risk_assessment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  signal_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> references</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> safety_signal(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  matrix_version    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  severity          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  probability       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vulnerability     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  base_level        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  final_level       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  uplift_reason     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assessed_by       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assessed_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  supersedes_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> references</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> risk_assessment(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 复评时保留历史：只标记被取代，不删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">signal_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">matrix_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">final_level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assessed_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">uplift_reason</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> risk_assessment a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">signal_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">order by</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assessed_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用 <code>supersedes_id</code> 形成链条而不是就地覆盖，是因为召回争议往往发生在数月之后，届时唯一能自证&quot;当时判断是合理的&quot;的材料，就是那一版评估与当时的矩阵版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从定级到处置动作\">从定级到处置动作</h2><p>等级不直接等于召回，它决定的是下一跳动作。把映射关系固定下来，可以避免每次都由人来裁量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>最终等级</th>\n<th>立即动作</th>\n<th>时限要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>严重</td>\n<td>停售评估 + 启动法定上报判断</td>\n<td>当日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>上报判断 + 批次定位 + 补充证据</td>\n<td>24 小时内立项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>补充证据后复评</td>\n<td>5 个工作日内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>记录并纳入趋势监测</td>\n<td>常规节奏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;高&quot;这一档的 24 小时立项要求，与法定上报的时间窗有关：CPSC 的规则要求企业在获得足以支持结论的信息后立即报告，其定义是 24 小时内；而欧盟侧对严重产品安全风险的强制事故报告时限是<strong>两个工作日</strong>。分级流程必须比法定时限更早收紧，否则上报窗口会被内部流程吃掉。具体上报要求见 <a href=\"statutory-incident-notification\">Safety Gate/CPSC 法定事故报告</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>产品安全定级需要严重程度、可能性、暴露人群三个维度。</li>\n<li>矩阵对 S 与 P 非对称处理，为致死类危害保留零容错空间。</li>\n<li>暴露人群通过等级上调而非重算基分生效，保留可解释性。</li>\n<li>低权重证据可以触发评估，但不能支撑定级结论。</li>\n<li>评估记录用取代链保存历史，支撑事后自证。</li>\n<li>分级时限必须严于法定上报时限（CPSC 24 小时口径、欧盟两个工作日）。</li>\n<li>达到等级后的召回决策路径见 <a href=\"../recall-execution/recall-decision-regulator-communication\">召回决策与监管沟通</a>。</li>\n<li>定级所依赖的信号来源见 <a href=\"injury-signal-collection\">事故/伤害信号多源采集</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>参考来源：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/1115.12\">16 CFR § 1115.12 — Cornell LII</a>（缺陷模式、已分销数量、风险严重度、暴露人群等评估因素；严重身体伤害的列举口径）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/2064\">15 U.S.C. § 2064 — Cornell LII</a>（&quot;substantial product hazard&quot;的法定定义与报告义务触发条件）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Product_Safety_Regulation\">General Product Safety Regulation — Wikipedia</a>（严重产品安全风险的强制事故报告时限为两个工作日）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"安全风险评估与危害分级","id":"安全风险评估与危害分级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个正交维度","id":"核心概念-三个正交维度"},{"level":2,"text":"三维度的锚点定义","id":"三维度的锚点定义"},{"level":3,"text":"严重程度 S","id":"严重程度-s"},{"level":3,"text":"发生可能性 P","id":"发生可能性-p"},{"level":3,"text":"暴露人群 V","id":"暴露人群-v"},{"level":2,"text":"风险矩阵与定级","id":"风险矩阵与定级"},{"level":2,"text":"证据权重与不确定性","id":"证据权重与不确定性"},{"level":3,"text":"评估记录的可追溯结构","id":"评估记录的可追溯结构"},{"level":2,"text":"从定级到处置动作","id":"从定级到处置动作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事故/伤害信号多源采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/safety-signal-incident-report/injury-signal-collection"},"next":{"title":"Safety Gate/CPSC 法定事故报告","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/safety-signal-incident-report/statutory-incident-notification"}}